    "short_description": "The Godzilla REST API: pipelines (v3), events (v3), connectors, transforms, webhooks, rate limits, and error reference.",
    "body": "{{ds:component/hero|title=API Reference|subtitle=Every endpoint in the Godzilla REST API, with request/response examples.|cta_html=<a href="{{cms:item/65a5f692-bb10-4ad1-889a-28a19b3f4610}}">Start with Pipelines</a>}}

<section>
  <p>All endpoints require a bearer <a href="{{cms:item/c49993c9-9721-427a-bc08-3e482681fbbe}}">API key</a>. The pipelines and events endpoints are on v3 (<code>https://api.godzilladocs.dev/v3</code>), while all other endpoints currently live under <code>https://api.godzilladocs.dev/v2</code>. New to the API? Read <a href="{{cms:item/c49993c9-9721-427a-bc08-3e482681fbbe}}">Authentication</a> in Getting Started first.</p>

  {{ds:component/card|href={{cms:item/65a5f692-bb10-4ad1-889a-28a19b3f4610}}|tag=Endpoint (v3) · Stable|title=Pipelines|description=Create, list, and manage pipelines via the v3 API.}}
